    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1312">

                <pb facs="1572" n="1374" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1374"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Department of the Army Files: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1312<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Chairman of the Interim
                        Committee</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of War</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stimson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">operational priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-23">23 July 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">War</hi> 36792. Secretary of War <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Eyes Only</hi> top secret from Harrison.</p>
                <p>Operation may be possible any time from August 1 depending on state of
                    preparation of patient and condition of atmosphere. From point of view of
                    patient only, some chance August 1 to 3, good chance August 4 to 5 and barring
                    unexpected relapse almost certain before August 10.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
